    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32555" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπαίω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw</i> or <i>cast out of</i> a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">με δόξης ἐξέπαισαν ἐλπίδες</span> they
				<i>have dashed</i> me <i>from</i> my expectations, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				460
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>dash out, escape,</i>
