				22.17
			</span></i> (Casaubon for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέπεσε</span>) :—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Brut.</u>
				51
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπαίω.</span>)</div>
